reat  opportunity for me to do something i've  wanted to do for  a while so i'm going to be shooting some  new videos and they're going to be  shorter they're going to be focused not  just on philosophy  but on all these other things having to  do with speculative fiction and i'm  going to begin with ursula k le guin  with two of her stories but i'm also  going to begin  with something else that i i read as i  was preparing for the philip jose farmer  and i want to follow up on which is  his story the lovers so that will be  coming out  this month as well new videos new kinds  of videos and hopefully  people will will enjoy them and and get  something out of them so  a lot of stuff coming up in  this month of august my two of my  classes  ethics for artisan designers and ursula  k le greens earth c  philosophy and literature are starting  towards the end of the month and i'm  also gearing up for the third class that  i'm teaching for carthage college a  business ethics class  which will begin in september so there  we go  i hope you can make it to some of these  online events and i hope you have a  great month ahead  you

